OL,3,AShares in Musk's SpaceX plunge as tech
OL,4,Aand AI stocks fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FShares in Elon Musk's SpaceX have
OL,7,Fplunged as tech and artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence stocks more broadly
OL,9,Fplummeted a day after the Democrats
OL,10,Fswept to victory in the midterms.
OL,12,FThose losses dragged the tech-heavy
OL,13,FNasdaq Composite stock index down,
OL,14,Fwhich had fallen by more than 5% at one
OL,15,Fpoint in early trading.
OL,17,FThe market has been reacting to
OL,18,Fpossible tougher scrutiny of data
OL,19,Fcentre construction and the artificial
OL,20,Fintelligence (AI) industry following
OL,21,FDemocrat wins in key data centre states
OL,22,Fincluding Texas.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
